#: ../../source/flexdesigner/plugins.md:17
msgid ""
"You can drag buttons from the plugin to the editing area and use them just "
"like built-in buttons."
msgstr ""
"プラグイン側のキーを編集エリアへドラッグし、"
"標準キーと同様に使えます。"

