#: ../../source/flexdesigner/plugins.md:25
msgid "Managing Plugins"
msgstr "プラグインの管理"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/plugins.md:27
msgid ""
"Click the information button to view detailed information about the plugin. "
"Here you can update or delete the plugin."
msgstr ""
"情報ボタンでプラグインの詳細を表示できます。"
" ここから更新や削除も行えます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/plugins.md:29
